# Super Monkey Ball Deluxe (53450038), single route. lane.titleroutes
# session 46, 2026-09-30, from the Thor survey
# 0-0-s-1790823793-titleroutes-2949342 (route-frames, booted at 20:28:20
# PDT). DRAFT until a soak replays it.
#
# What the survey's START/A cycles reached (one press every ~5.5 s):
#   202826  "There is no Game Data on your Xbox console. Please press A."
#   202846  "Do you want to save Game Data?" YES highlighted (A takes it)
#   202912  Mode Select, Main Game highlighted
#   202944  Data Select, slot 1 "Start the game from the beginning"
#   203030  stage 1-1 SIMPLE, timer 57:50: the 10th cycle's A started it
#   203050  START in play opens Continue game / Retry / ...; A continues
# The survey never tilted the stage, so the ball sat at 0 mph; the FPS
# overlay read 59 throughout the stage.
#
# So: ten cycles, then tilt with the left stick and no START (it pauses).
# A in play does nothing; after a goal it advances the result screen.
# If the disk ever carries this title's game data, the first prompt is
# gone and the cycles overshoot into the stage, where START pauses and the
# following A continues: the route still ends in play.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
mark booted
repeat 10 {
    press START
    wait 5
    shot menu-start
    press A
    wait 5
    shot menu-a
}
axis LY min
wait 3
shot rolling
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 4
    axis LX max
    wait 0.5
    axis LX min
    wait 0.5
    axis LX mid
    press A
    wait 2
    axis LY mid
    wait 1
    shot play
}
